  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A person of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> mass is standing on the rim of a circular platform of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> rotating about its axis at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> revolutions per minute (rpm). The person now starts moving towards the centre of the platform. What will be the rotational speed (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>rpm</mi></math> ) of the platform when the person reaches its centre....",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Applying conservation of angular momentum,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>mR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>MR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>MR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>200</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>200</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>rev</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>sec</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
